  <notes>
    <completion-summary>
      COMPLETED 2026-09-30 (SESSION 27). Full record: notes/t226-shared-secret-read-path.md §5 (owner dispositions),
      §6 (correction + gate round 1), §7 (completion record, gate round 2, final verification).
      - H4-shared, its DAG edge, handler id, DI/dispatch registrations and exclusively-owned types are deleted;
        `from-shared-service` is gone from the manifest, the generator, the reader and the resolver. H4b ← H4.
