        AiSearch--AdminKey, AzureOpenAI-ApiKey, Storage-ConnectionString, PromptFlow-Endpoint/-Key (D5).
      - Kept, interim, from the customer's OWN resources via customer.bicep (owner D13): Redis-ConnectionString
        (→ T242) and DocumentIntelligence-ApiKey (→ T243). ADR-028 tension recorded in spec.md (Path A).
      - Bing / LlamaParse labelled Spaarke-shared vendor keys (D5).
      - Fixed a production defect: task 214's `from-topology-constants` was unknown to the reader + generator, so
        every H4 run failed ManifestReadFailed (17 of T221's 23 baseline failures).
      - Also: StaticKvSecretManifest deleted; generator duplicate-key tie-break; H8 trims containerTypeId;
